## 解答摘要

从 $S_3$ 到 $Z_2$ 的群同态**恰好有两个**：

### 1. 平凡同态 $\varphi_0$
$$\varphi_0(g) = 0, \quad \forall\, g \in S_3$$
- $\ker(\varphi_0) = S_3$，$|\ker| = 6$
- $\operatorname{im}(\varphi_0) = \{0\}$，$|\operatorname{im}| = 1$
- $6 = 6 \times 1$ ✓

### 2. 符号同态 $\varphi_1$（奇偶性映射）
$$\varphi_1(g) = \operatorname{sgn}(g) \bmod 2 = \begin{cases} 0 & g \text{ 偶置换} \\ 1 & g \text{ 奇置换}\end{cases}$$
- $\ker(\varphi_1) = A_3 = \{e, (123), (132)\}$，$|\ker| = 3$
- $\operatorname{im}(\varphi_1) = Z_2 = \{0, 1\}$，$|\operatorname{im}| = 2$
- $6 = 3 \times 2$ ✓

### 核心推理链

1. **第一同构定理**给出 $|S_3| = |\ker(\varphi)| \times |\operatorname{im}(\varphi)|$，即 $6 = |\ker| \times |\operatorname{im}|$
2. $\operatorname{im}(\varphi) \leq Z_2$，故 $|\operatorname{im}| \in \{1, 2\}$，只有两种情形
3. $|\operatorname{im}| = 1 \Rightarrow$ 平凡同态；$|\operatorname{im}| = 2 \Rightarrow |\ker| = 3$
4. $S_3$ 的唯一3阶正规子群是 $A_3$，故非平凡同态的核唯一确定为 $A_3$
5. **完备性**通过三种独立方法验证：正规子群枚举、生成元关系分析、暴力枚举 $2^6=64$ 种映射

